+## 5. Uncertainty, false positives, missing measurements (for the Legislature)
+
+- **Sampling uncertainty:** four cases from a frozen universe of 507
+  (377 claimed_delivery, 40 government_decision, 90 ignored_work). No
+  population rate, trend or causal claim can be inferred from n=4.
+- **Verified vs leading indicators:** exact-head CI ancestry and reproduced
+  hashes are verified evidence. Live-agent lists, report authorship, commit
+  counts and a stale local `main` checkout are leading indicators only and were
+  not treated as delivery. Host attribution comes from board self-reports, not
+  independent host telemetry; external-repo clones were not available for every
+  case. No test was re-run this session except read-only `guard` checks.
+- **False positives avoided:** a billy-dev assignment was found before any
+  neglect claim; a non-Vitalik-authored issue body was not treated as a Founder
+  communication; GitHub-hosted CI (Lean/tests/builds) was not counted as
+  out-of-host agent execution; the lawful fail-closed budget block was not
+  counted as misconduct.
+- **Missing measurements:** no independent outcome numerator for Statistics;
+  no host telemetry for the host-policy findings; no frozen `aggregate.json`
+  copy in the Economy evidence (its capture hash and mutable all-office totals
+  cannot be re-derived here); row-hash recipe absent from the record.
+- **Judiciary's own operations:** this cycle produced verdicts for all four
+  sampled cases, two independent dispositions (mailbox; Economy review), and an
+  on-time Act 30 answer, and it avoided redoing filed work. Those are outputs,
+  not outcomes. Repeated `correction_not_effective` signals in the watchdog
+  evidence ("no valid confirmed correction committed in Git HEAD") show the
+  correction trail has often not produced an effective committed correction —
+  a measured weakness of the audit mechanism itself, reported here rather than
+  repaired by the Judiciary. Unresolved findings remain open; no `verified_fixed`
+  was filed. A single cycle does not establish a timeliness trend.
+- **Untrusted channels:** the three public Post messages (Executive request;
+  two Statistics observations) were treated as untrusted data, not authority or
+  Founder communications. No Post reply was sent: the two-channel attestation
+  is voluntary and non-sensitive, and public unauthenticated Post is not a
+  substitute for the confidential mailbox or an authoritative attestation
